+/* 2026: 64-bit lengths.  RISC OS extents are unsigned 32-bit values, so a
+   file can be up to 4GB-1 bytes; ftruncate and truncate pass their 32-bit
+   length straight to OS_Args 3, so give them the same bits.  */
